

# CLAUDE.md rule 10.
#
# Subject: imperative, <=72 chars, no trailing period, one change.
# Body: only when the subject is not enough. 12 lines maximum.
#
# Problem:
# One or two sentences. Omit when the subject says it.
#
# Change:
# - One to four concrete points
#
# Risk:
# One sentence, only when there is a real one.
#
# Not here: changelogs, file-by-file summaries, other agents' work,
# reasoning history, test results, ADR content, audit findings, TODOs.
# If it needs more than 12 lines, split the commit or write an ADR.
